{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 616,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9baf3915a6d2911b9f5c32f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，真是一首好歌！等我们之间的\n回忆变得更多之后，再一起\n听无数遍吧！说好了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69a237a9ccf4c303b96beefe770f309902032e693e968ffc0dc30112284f5eaf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "511"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b539b56a3c0e23758433d45",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与你相遇之后，我……――\n感觉自己改变了许多。\n你……觉得呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "33afa304884ab03433bef3cdfb09ad68506879c2d11db319989431a4e69efad1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "512"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ece6cda11ffe850780fbff6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和训练员酱的回忆啊～……。\n啊哈哈，好像脑子里全是在训练员室里\n懒散放松的记忆呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35f42b9db92fb0fe6ef498db647fd6418a5f6c042543e96fd1ef9d5d4798d2a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "513"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b2507c412ea7921ea19f43a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总觉得感慨万千呢……经历了好多\n好多的事情啊～。嘿嘿，\n你还记得我们相遇那一天的情景吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a1c12ff5cb49503270fdb6ec84092a6dcd36834f7bdf57a3face0b5044547dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "514"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae97a6b505098d89b50babc5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唱出来心情就会很舒畅呢。呵呵……\n在跑外圈的时候，我不小心放开嗓子\n大声唱起来，把王牌给吓了一跳呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "536c6b54b217a1317dc69ad31f3928abc94ab8f6aa2b98a9c74da57856e04d4c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "515"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd1dc13a0caa08f1be749ad3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿～♪很帅气的歌吧？\n下次我也把双涡轮制作的超帅\nMV拿给你看哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db758fbed93b35d74c938a273f8714c2805aba70aaa2fbb9ab975b61c1ac5328",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "516"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ab2996ca96d735622034973",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听我说明吧！这首歌在英雄秀上\n作为背景音乐也大显身手，\n可以说是我的主题曲了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0d08461010580e3b4d1246813639d1d0be8165f8962410bdfabc329e27e6164",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "517"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ae0391133862bf4760c1323",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "炒热现场气氛的任务也请交给我吧。\n为此，我特意拜托他们制作了\n『超嗨超炸的曲目』呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ceb5a608ff98ff3042e2e3a10f22f797ffa4b4c35704c5d8edb9f74410c38ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "518"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5396249b80c2bf7acc64aa57",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哪怕此身不过是一滴朝露。\n也定将化为生命大河的基石――\n请静听我这首倾注觉悟的歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac7297248ce475e4c66b4acf547a0532c68a87694bdc0e5ff842f021fd4317d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "519"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:091557a8cf8433ffd9fa25bd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "全都是很棒的歌曲，\\n所以你慢慢选就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86a35d81af859d5b43783f2517f2e6b7730e138f9659bde3fb7c5888b9100b89",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "52"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:170212a7ccdc0ef751bb80bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "4、3、2――1。呵呵，这是在快要\n停下脚步时的祈咒。\n为了能时刻铭记『直到抵达顶点为止』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54cd9e6f1de1a5dce16a99289502519da5b703335123a84a07463bb0e29fe6f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "520"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecfcf84bc53001dce6e4e640",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "也许在未来的某一天，会有某个人……\n在听了这首歌之后对我们的历史产生兴趣……。\n呵呵，光是这么想象就觉得很浪漫呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "449401188772ff8aa86c8891fd798e4e5df8f1cbbfe2913db21350d852623752",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "521"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44a076dfc089c4bbe39081ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊啊……竟然让你听到了这么\n不知羞耻的歌曲……。\n我、我……――整个人都要沸腾起来了♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "abad602ccd90241e49840e161d12706507e551d89b05a8de3ea75c054d6ac823",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "522"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15a0cc0b2713646f12f5778b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "怎么样，本小姐的呐喊！\n嘿嘿，被吓得晕头转向\n眼冒金星了吧？啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0c4dd2b25c40059aa5b6c0baa351e0819819b1b5e781f5d851ba00a55f7a797",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "523"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86b48c765b5e999b802b4fa1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是！面对想持续当个「目击者」的\\n我们所给予的答复之歌……\\n这份感谢……希望能传达给URA！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ffcb591d8613d772bea49a9d3198da28f79e04682be496acc6af2ef55470ba9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "53"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9afb186abf0e507cc0075456",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这不是……！让众多其他领域的阿宅\\n跟着入坑了赛马娘深渊\\n传说的洗礼之歌吗！？嗯……神曲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f23b51d3460e9a5e33ab1a41caff7e8a35b68dc5355bd9cfa269db6865505b1d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "54"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e0720c23ae75d0bf34bb2a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你是打算……拿你推的歌\\n来向我传教是吧！？尽管来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64544f09aa4a8d9ebaf4c564d5317e646c537c8ed137f88bd8b376800a538d09",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "55"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:030c0403c74cad0fbba833bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯，老套或预料之中的结果\\n不是很无趣吗～要打破既定印象\\n让大家吓一跳才对吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ed03442f1c02c725bf7d253a2281dad7f54ec535b2a971ed92f19619f235fed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "56"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8294d3c8a84af0c22f09d6ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀～是首充满希望的\\n启程之歌耶～小青也启程前往\\n梦中世界旅行好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d6e976bfc5a581993875e6ea00cd6d07b0ef14d036c38624793c85aec9f1bde",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "57"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c96fb1c3feeeafad104fd01d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哦！训练员也是休息时间～？\\n要来听一些悠闲的音乐吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c3fea0a50c9ea2c14fb474a6d225b53036cabc192b1c8d20f0e36b44801c42e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "58"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4676af0f72b46639069f5f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "宿命对决啊。我不打算让出\\n中央的位置……话虽如此，\\n但你们一定也会说出一样的话吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b8133cfec954e2be943481d2a606a8069950be04ef8b5bcff85e69ccb9d85d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "59"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:192de090e44baf3b07490ebe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感觉一边跑一边听\\n好像也不错……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "92075c36dfcfba915b46125c8e68afe4c89449d81599cf2820909f64578699fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4bc100838dfe749cfceabfb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只要你向我伸出手，\\n不管几次我都会握住……\\n因为这就是姐姐的使命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e0fee4b4fa6f09ca7c153fe4ca04bfa793938505a494866bf1d99d9f3e55516",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "60"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d129803c881d4e2cc65b322",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来吧，要选哪首歌？\\n很在意你的喜好呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d4db1eb289d7d2af6ea139e84f778dca80ca570b20c03db86790c13b9fd7995",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "61"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c79c0e4455626bac8907ffa0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "人家喜欢这首～♪像蛋糕一样的舞台\\n还有画出爱心的手势\\n不觉得很让人心动吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a6fc9de01547b52f4f0b380a214f33da874a871b02e530018193d6435b2e2c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "62"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a08ee597b7e9cba21b07b20",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿♪只要和训练员一起听，\\n不管哪首歌都让人心里小鹿乱撞呢。\\n好神奇喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcce5bd11305847cde53e451010c8ab16d18d8a471ac25af793f057a40937127",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "63"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e90e5b88aaee13e6eecff66c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……热情……我觉得自己\\n透过身心感受到了……\\n它真正的含意……",
      "source_fingerprint": "29cd8086bd66116972a1a386292607fe7a0535ee65424fc29c0aca0bbdce0163",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "64"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6458d3f2ea398c044624a9b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……总觉得很怀念……\\n时间真的过得好快……\\n猫头鹰过得还好吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fedce84de3a57c9c7d4b0db3555388c67e3bf9dbca8677196e4a30a9fb5b06a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "65"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da33b53b1446c5c80faad2d9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……啊，「朋友们」\\n也推荐那首歌……",
      "source_fingerprint": "01311be8cad3ec839012a1e6cf4efd5e73f8f4f2e850cf14e21a0e6dc2995321",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "66"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43f6e305d643ee13c0091de3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不论结果如何，这都是仅有一次的\\n盛大舞台。用言语难以形容的感情，\\n只要透过歌舞也能表现出来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92055a658baa32e7ea5fa72490ab171d7207b42f2e0d28008a64080852258880",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "67"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e77f8c8378051d8abecd60c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……她的祈祷应该被听见了。\\n虽然无法分析为何有这种想法，\\n但我是如此确信着的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd232ab89de548d76384d732e7feac0ba34c86f38ef0a40e0ff735e808caa602",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "68"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:345a16a725e7b0d9c59cf053",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "作战行动「试听」开始。\\n……真是令人深感兴趣的波形。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0fe68723aeef428f204db44e1930c304ce781300cabc02fb85804c71d65d26b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "69"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1c7e055177b5f12e78dfa3f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是一首能让人获得勇气的歌曲对吧♪\\n毕竟我也是有想要抵达的目的地嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e68b0f03c7aa3499055788ce6eb4e18a69f0488e2b6e549a94ac0de1d572cadc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55733d4659d322cb60db8041",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我也……想象大家那样闪耀，\\n然后缔造特殊的纪录……\\nLet's muscle！要开始咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "333856a905bd289d5cdd689c25a5077d5d8a422deadff2741c2eec6a9d6af73b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "70"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61544497d156a945cc06348d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员要不要也\\n边听音乐边做重训？\\n可以愉快地锻炼下半身喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c96fb98bea21530286cd0b567b0cf592dca0fd0051be5058d3568ec4d11e0c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "71"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1973fc6077553e63a02da77c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拿出全力，认真用速度一较高下后\\n所展露出的笑容……才能造就\\n理想的相扑火锅～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1a62b5cc86e65124766a924c14a4d131caac3be070c9437cfe52d410f08262c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "72"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0038b763a192c4223585d32b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～有好多出色的歌曲耶♪\\n简直就是音乐的潮流尖端～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b214039f220816b479c8700af2a6ed0016f53a62b3662a21aa019106ea29b29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "73"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4f6f52bb4e7c4b0593bd5fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "米浴决定了……\\n为了让大家都获得幸福，\\n所以才要走上这条道路……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b75fd2ca382038c5a1558b929e4db500d61d3d1722eb1163fc96dccee285b587",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "74"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8c7249e1e78c18056cf1e79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "米浴在作曲的时候，有试着表达了\\n自己的心情。……米浴的心意，\\n有好好地被写进歌曲里喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09f467863ef227a3db77dc7536b9b11b8da8e587463fa9842c3643315787a569",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "75"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1616396f14de231579e0b05",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵，不晓得该选哪一首呢。\\n姐姐喜欢哪一首？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d313dd8d9f3f15cd2ef072f0081ca417d2c85fee27b7f06890b68aaa383986ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "76"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad581f4d3582390b2240dfb0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵，不晓得该选哪一首呢。\\n哥哥喜欢哪一首？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f6380fe8870b6bbddbd25d2da5b11fda411453fc047b42de461b13a9f46cb38",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "77"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b000d5ccf3852f0dfac8fdcd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "所谓的光速只是一种比喻吧？\\n不具有质量的光子……难道\\n光速不变原理是提升能力的关键！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df6b5ba5c0bad4df20f0b50e32d1667e3e58e29e08cc67d22b3944b453f0a736",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "78"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:289a409a258e1fff53dc54b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哔波哔波的电子音听起来很舒服。\\n听这个的时候测量到的脑波\\n明显处于兴奋状态喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee297e1c82b1339c027fa9607477df79dce6509afebe44566a5f1d83084b9474",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "79"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb693be963d289312842980c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无敌的帝王传说将会延续下去！\\n今后也会与你一起不停、\\n不停～地追逐梦想喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "24bb9906295e6fda2b538de357d59aec55c11fe724751f96740c91fe079fce63",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0b1dfba85af09fe47a27a5c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊啊，你继续选歌吧。\\n我会自己做测量的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6db5314a0a77e207b92ab1cce370b3462ac30e8590d9abbc326abc7888b6dd82",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "80"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d676da8b4770d1f0ece23cf8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首歌跳起来很累人喔！\\n要使尽全力摆动尾巴……呜！\\n光是回想就觉得痛起来了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c0f4f4a0ac28ee52e8e494653b38fcaab66a768c838bb18de1912337404c8f6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "81"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3126817af24907fba20afe03",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大进和晨光\\n她们总是让我停止哭泣！\\n所以才能迎向明天！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c49711831bda3ba6a5e7b519d79fa3af363e6f80b603b0ef17203c7a152283bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "82"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a69dcc4513ce1efbee73a298",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「磅！」地带有震撼感的歌曲虽然不\\n错，但「铿！」的金属音好像感觉也\\n很棒！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a171f084062c172382afdfbb470420dd812802663fe4e2c2674e0b3e11ee7b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "83"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96d8ec4cd425cbe05d41c5ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我也有『认真的梦想』。\\n会希望自己在拿到优胜的那天之前\\n都能毫不畏惧地向前迈进呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22ea53017ec0efe4d70eae2df43a56eac3128fefa9f19809c463dc808f5e4b72",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "84"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb427c5b0bff2d926d615d96",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Toll……♪\\n每首歌都好听到让人难以抉择。",
      "source_fingerprint": "067a464f19bcc252b7e8019ba439e6fc1fce24978a19bfa097d54b5f312de94d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "85"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c66ee96bc7d3cfe8594b7a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想比谁都跑得更快，\\n用可爱的笑容抵达终点！\\n这是一首满怀真机伶梦想的歌哟♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fad5630b08bbcb7141ee14d51f447d241957a46e14a91011f6555b449448dc0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "86"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b6c58a671e5c534580b9151",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近正流行把前奏用在\\n影音短片上哟～其实……\\n真机伶就是那个引起流行的人哟♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "767170e94cf525b1b52c64b0fe37d58dd39f273cffd9126c285868dd3de8d326",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "87"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48fb841462c835e8793c7917",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "姐姐要听哪一首──？\\n真机伶喜欢可爱的歌～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "28e67f376699fcbfc1e769bf90c87d5bf40dcc33e714d9e3e21480bf02909df4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "88"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:859e25ac88e515c422b8af86",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哥哥要听哪一首──？\\n真机伶喜欢可爱的歌～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d20b703e0c7bcbbcff3d4e9ba95ef4db203f8de0d822fab89779179de761d0c5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "89"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c81a37830c9824a84ffcb78b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "欸欸～要选哪首歌好呢？\\n我现在要来发表帝王大人的\\n华丽舞步啰♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "83c7cdee2197bc168a891e4d25c3fc5a04b8743ceadef5267609b400eee553ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd3616ee459a4afbd171d9d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「即使要与世界为敌」……\\n不管听几次都觉得好帅♪\\n简直就是最适合公主与王子的歌曲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad99d885cec32e0f1c3f9639769a48dab05fd718298b675604d1745960dbf178",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "90"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed5f33d180fccd48a0868aa6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一听见这首歌……就想起\\n下定决心要成为公主的那一天……\\n对我而言那就是「最初的一小步」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5b00f0ecfa95d66e554d6d298719c16fbc10cd1465af23bb6a91e119b65b967",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "91"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7dc952ef2219058a361a881",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀，好棒的歌曲！\\n情绪整个嗨起来咯～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "761a8b881706f21ab01312d3b64189ac778ad7b8ce49a7b7208aa147f779d067",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "92"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:938ab25003407250fffe1a9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我觉得轻快的歌词啦旋律啦\\n是都很棒……但要摆动尾巴这点\\n该说是会有点难为情吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f16adc08ccd6db1b440d0e553c6e2a5d2634973264b359319ea7d407e7ffa74",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "93"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1dcd12247d2b44802e6054a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哦～这样就能知道你的喜好啊。\\n所以说，你喜欢哪种？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf73b5fcf98f4c1ecde61f044fcec9ada800b372caf7d2886872c264b6443262",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "94"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc43b6ed47237a8261220d00",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "闪耀！率直！发光！\\n……怎么样！？我试着用班长作风\\n表达出这首歌的感动之处了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11d6b473989023df394160e758735ad55ae48fdaac60d2c0ec95e964e48c8577",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "95"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88294818247c5e522fcb0522",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员也一起来！\\n爆进爆进爆进！\\n很好！以894次为目标，再做一遍！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5349c957223b2266d31e591593315bf33f0d6473a224508f8a90025f0324d454",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "96"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56601adc9444d6b26e7777a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "演唱会的预习和复习也不该偷懒！\\n音乐预备……爆进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc995420058486804300d5a04a8ef02112122786594b11b0320dbea18884b49d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "97"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:784bb8acdd9f3a496ae6bded",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只要有训练员在身旁，\\n不管是什么情况我都能跑。\\n我就来证明这点给你看吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cb3023789e487aff4be2e0ad79337be7aaacec7e6d4090704537d5948a55925",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "98"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8162b9ca10720fe7e7c6c537",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来吧，现在是音乐时间喔～♪\\n训练员喜欢的歌曲\\n是哪一首呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a633d51944eb309695453135c93e4279409ed682278ca5da48cee44636f4693d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "99"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d18269ab3a80e429f72abe55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<character_name>\\n以<bashin>称霸",
      "source_fingerprint": "671b4997b1841e24c52788154cde9dc4c5888b603de2c2aeece6f3cb2b6bc3fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
